{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02533","headline":"春朝闲步 · 杨师道","name":"春朝闲步","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休沐乘闲豫，清晨步北林。\n池塘藉芳草，兰芷袭幽衿。\n雾中分晓日，花里弄春禽。\n野迳香恒满，山阶笋屡侵。\n何须命轻盖，桃李自成阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}